[TEXT] Got full picture. Confirmed:
- `web0.local` (FQDN) → **resolves** (authoritative zone works)
- `web0` (short name) → **REFUSED** (`recursion no` + no search domain)
- ICMP and HTTP-by-IP both work perfectly

Root cause isolated: dns_server config has `recursion no`, hosts have no `search local` in resolv.conf. All hostname-based access fails with REFUSED.

